    <string name="conn_steps_wifi">1. Turn on Wi-Fi.\n2. Settings → Developer options → turn on \"Wireless debugging\".\n3. Tap \"Pair device with pairing code\". The window shows a 6-digit code and a port. Do not close it: open ADB-phon in split-screen or a floating window.\n4. Enter the port and the code below and press \"Pair\".\n5. Press \"Connect\".</string>
